{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "110", "x": 0.8999865999885377, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03375664861509805, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Well, one piece of work that I felt really satisfied with during my studies was when", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8262745671575868, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I had to write a research paper for one of my university courses. It was about", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8259902654606861, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "language acquisition and how children learn languages in their early years.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.7635310383532524, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I chose this topic because, you know, I've always been really curious about how", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21797572598214812, "w": 0.826275592407125, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "people pick up languages, especially when they're young. Also, it was something", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.24630607605628574, "w": 0.8260551637564446, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that really tied into what I wanted to do in my career, teaching English, you know.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2746735439806541, "w": 0.8261640452573853, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "So, I thought it would be a great opportunity to explore the topic more deeply.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3030039694975767, "w": 0.7947746978256405, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaking of the help that I got, well, I had some great resources to help me out.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3412721524535729, "w": 0.8258379133793322, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "First of all, my professor was super supportive, who gave me lots of guidance and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.36945418201235786, "w": 0.8262512939930732, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "pointing me in the right direction when I got stuck. I also spent quite a bit of time", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.39778456980788796, "w": 0.826273439383095, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in the library reading academic papers and books, which gave me a lot of ideas", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4261149576034181, "w": 0.8258812814347917, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and food for thought in this area. But what inspired me the most was the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4544453076775557, "w": 0.8260335309911918, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "discussions that I had with my classmates. We often bounced ideas off each other,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.48280040298518045, "w": 0.8266731841779801, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and I think this kind of collaboration really helped me refine my thoughts.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5111307907807106, "w": 0.7470021190882702, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Why did I feel satisfied? Well, it was partly because all the hard work paid off. I", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5875189493415278, "w": 0.8259682225956181, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "ended up getting a pretty good grade on the project. But honestly, it wasn't just", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6158493371370579, "w": 0.8267813480042441, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "about the grade. I mean, I was pleasantly surprised by how well I did, but what", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6441796872111956, "w": 0.8261425150170862, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "meant even more to me was the process itself. The research, the writing, the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6725471551355638, "w": 0.8258812814347917, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "feedback, all of them came together in a way that really taught me a lot. It felt", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7008775052097015, "w": 0.8261360559449966, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "incredibly rewarding to see how everything clicked in the end, and more than", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7292079307266242, "w": 0.8260195875974743, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "anything, it was the sense of growth I experienced that made the whole thing so", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7575382808007618, "w": 0.8259899578858247, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "satisfying.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7858686308748994, "w": 0.11030249680045251, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "part3", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8622815346692038, "w": 0.06317436429146081, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "1.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9005498119286812, "w": 0.020609553398225476, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, I think one area people really feel dissatisfied with is their career. You", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.9005498119286812, "w": 0.765840412937706, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "know, a lot of people might feel like they're stuck in a job that doesn't match their", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9288801620028189, "w": 0.8263204983368915, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}